    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110064/4901100640020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100640030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "未成年の出演者さんを\r\n先に撮ってもらってたら、この時間になっちゃいました",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110064/4901100640030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……そんなことが\r\n千雪も、お疲れ様だな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100640040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、はい\r\nでも、プロデューサーさんがいらっしゃってよかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110064/4901100640040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100640050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "お疲れ様、って言っていただけると\r\nなんだか心が落ち着きますもん",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110064/4901100640050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100640060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうだ、プロデューサーさん\r\n晩ご飯、召しあがってます……？",
